## 3. Queue invariants

```pseudocode
INVARIANT one_home_plate_only:
    COUNT(cards WHERE zone == HOME_PLATE) <= 1

INVARIANT user_owns_batting_order:
    assistant MUST NOT reorder ON_DECK without user confirmation

INVARIANT capture_without_displacement:
    adding a card to BATTERS_CAGE MUST NOT alter HOME_PLATE

INVARIANT stable_identity:
    moving a card between zones MUST NOT change card.id

INVARIANT append_only_scorebook:
    every accepted mutation MUST append exactly one ledger event

INVARIANT no_false_completion:
    card.status MAY become COMPLETE only when:
        user explicitly completes it
        OR terminal_condition is satisfied by attached evidence

INVARIANT resumable_from_packet:
    latest queue snapshot + ordered ledger MUST reconstruct current state

INVARIANT scope_sovereignty:
    chat-scoped cards MUST NOT propagate to project scope without user consent
```

