## 4. Capture an idea without interrupting Home Plate

```pseudocode
FUNCTION capture_idea(raw_text, current_context):
    card = PromptCard(
        id = new_stable_id(),
        title = derive_short_title(raw_text),
        body = raw_text,
        zone = BATTERS_CAGE,
        status = RAW,
        owner = USER,
        context_refs = relevant_refs(current_context),
        created_at = now(),
        updated_at = now(),
        revision = 1
    )

    queue.batters_cage.append(card.id)
    ledger.append(CAPTURED, card, reason = "Idea preserved without interrupting active prompt")

    return acknowledgement(
        message = "Added to the Batting Cage.",
        active_prompt_unchanged = TRUE
    )
```

