## 5. Refine a card in the Batting Cage

```pseudocode
FUNCTION refine_card(card_id, refinement_request):
    card = require_card(card_id)
    REQUIRE card.zone IN [BATTERS_CAGE, DUGOUT, ON_DECK]

    proposal = assistant_refine(
        original = card.body,
        instruction = refinement_request,
        preserve_commanders_intent = TRUE
    )

    IF proposal changes scope OR terminal_condition OR owner:
        REQUIRE user_confirmation(proposal)

    previous = snapshot(card)
    card.body = proposal.body
    card.title = proposal.title OR card.title
    card.status = proposal.ready ? READY : REFINING
    card.revision += 1
    card.updated_at = now()

    ledger.append(REFINED, before = previous, after = snapshot(card))
    return card
```

