## 6. Move a card On Deck

```pseudocode
FUNCTION move_on_deck(card_id, requested_position = END, actor):
    card = require_card(card_id)

    IF actor == ASSISTANT:
        REQUIRE explicit_user_confirmation()

    remove_from_all_queue_zones(card.id)
    queue.on_deck.insert(card.id, requested_position)
    card.zone = ON_DECK
    card.status = READY

    commit_revision(card, queue)
    ledger.append(QUEUED_ON_DECK, card, position = requested_position)

    return queue.on_deck
```

