## 9. Conversation router

```pseudocode
FUNCTION route_user_message(message):
    intent = classify_queue_intent(message)

    MATCH intent:
        CASE CAPTURE_ONLY:
            return capture_idea(intent.payload, conversation_context)

        CASE CAPTURE_ON_DECK:
            card = capture_idea(intent.payload, conversation_context)
            return move_on_deck(card.id, END, USER)

        CASE REORDER_QUEUE:
            return reorder_on_deck(intent.card_ids)

        CASE REFINE_CARD:
            return refine_card(intent.card_id, intent.instructions)

        CASE ADVANCE_QUEUE:
            return advance_to_home_plate()

        CASE PAUSE_ACTIVE:
            return move_home_plate_to_dugout()

        CASE COMPLETE_ACTIVE:
            return complete_home_plate(intent.result, intent.evidence)

        CASE NORMAL_PROMPT:
            return respond_normally(
                message,
                active_card = queue.home_plate,
                queue_summary = minimal_relevant_queue_context()
            )
```

