## 10. Context-budget policy

The queue must preserve continuity without flooding every model turn with every stored idea.

```pseudocode
FUNCTION minimal_relevant_queue_context():
    INCLUDE full body of HOME_PLATE card
    INCLUDE title + status of first ON_DECK card
    INCLUDE count of remaining ON_DECK and BATTERS_CAGE cards
    INCLUDE dependencies that affect HOME_PLATE
    INCLUDE latest confirmed mutation revision

    EXCLUDE full bodies of inactive cards unless semantically relevant
    EXCLUDE archived cards
    EXCLUDE private project cards outside authorized scope
```

