## 11. Conflict handling

```pseudocode
FUNCTION apply_mutation(mutation):
    IF mutation.base_revision != queue.revision:
        latest = load_latest_queue()
        conflicts = compare(mutation, latest)

        IF conflicts ARE EMPTY:
            rebase_and_apply(mutation, latest)
        ELSE:
            freeze_conflicting_fields()
            present_side_by_side_resolution(conflicts)
            REQUIRE user_resolution()

    checksum = CHECKSUM.validate(resulting_queue)
    REQUIRE checksum.valid

    persist(resulting_queue)
    ledger.append(mutation)
```

