## 12. Assistant authority matrix

| Action                                              | Assistant may propose |     Assistant may apply automatically     |
| --------------------------------------------------- | :-------------------: | :---------------------------------------: |
| Capture an explicitly dictated idea                 |          Yes          |                    Yes                    |
| Improve wording without changing intent             |          Yes          |       With visible revision history       |
| Attach evidence from a completed action             |          Yes          |                    Yes                    |
| Mark an evidence-backed mechanical task complete    |          Yes          |  Yes, when terminal condition is explicit |
| Reorder On Deck                                     |          Yes          |                     No                    |
| Replace Home Plate                                  |          Yes          |                     No                    |
| Change deadline, owner, scope, or success condition |          Yes          |                     No                    |
| Delete a card permanently                           |          Yes          |                     No                    |
| Archive a user-completed card                       |          Yes          | Only after configured confirmation policy |

