## 15. Minimal acceptance suite

```pseudocode
TEST capture_does_not_interrupt:
    GIVEN card A is HOME_PLATE
    WHEN user captures card B
    THEN B.zone == BATTERS_CAGE
    AND queue.home_plate == A.id

TEST only_one_home_plate:
    GIVEN A is HOME_PLATE and B is ON_DECK
    WHEN B is promoted
    THEN system requires disposition of A

TEST assistant_cannot_reorder_silently:
    GIVEN cards [A, B, C] are ON_DECK
    WHEN assistant proposes [C, A, B]
    THEN queue remains [A, B, C] until user confirms

TEST stable_identity_across_zones:
    GIVEN card A is BATTERS_CAGE
    WHEN A moves through ON_DECK to HOME_PLATE
    THEN A.id never changes

TEST evidence_backed_completion:
    GIVEN A has explicit terminal condition
    WHEN evidence satisfies that condition
    THEN A may become COMPLETE
    AND ledger contains completion evidence

TEST zero_context_recovery:
    GIVEN latest snapshot and ledger
    WHEN a fresh runtime imports the Garcia Packet
    THEN reconstructed queue equals last confirmed StateVector
```

