## 17. Journey Afterglow

The Pinned Mission Queue makes abundance manageable without forcing premature focus. Ideas are not discarded, and they are not allowed to hijack the present mission. They are captured, shaped, ordered, executed, and returned with evidence.

The user remains the manager. The assistant becomes the bench coach. The conversation stays at Home Plate while the future waits—visible, ready, and sovereign—On Deck.

**Garcia reached. The lineup survived the game.**
